_significant", "effect_strength": "none", "hedging": false, "claim": "Analysis of categorical variables including sex distribution, smoking status, and prior medication use revealed no significant differences between groups, indicating successful randomization."}], "primary_direction": "not_significant", "has_cross_section_conflict": false, "any_hedging": false, "sections": ["results"]}, {"test_type": "chi", "statistic_value": 26.74, "df1": 1.0, "df2": null, "reported_p": 0.02, "p_equality": "=", "two_tailed": true, "raw_text": "χ²(1) = 26.74, p = 0.02", "textual_interpretation": "a clinically meaningful and statistically significant improvement in disease outcomes", "interpretation_direction": "significant", "consistent": true, "notes": "primary efficacy endpoint: remission rate at 12 weeks", "interpretations": [{"section": "results", "sentence": "Specifically, 67% of treated patients (n = 48/72) achieved remission versus 38% in the control group (n = 27/71), χ²(1) = 26.74, p = 0.02, representing a clinically meaningful and statistically significant improvement in disease outcomes.", "keywords": ["significantly higher rate", "clinically meaningful", "statistically significant improvement"], "direction": "significant", "effect_strength": "strong", "hedging": false, "claim": "Patients receiving the novel IL-6 inhibitor demonstrated a significantly higher rate of clinical remission at 12 weeks compared to placebo controls, representing a clinically meaningful and statistically significant improvement in disease outcomes."}], "primary_direction": "significant", "has_cross_section_conflict": false, "any_hedging": false, "sections": ["results"]}, {"test_type": "z", "statistic_value": 3.2, "df1": null, "df2": null, "reported_p": 0.01, "p_equality": "=", "two_tailed": false, "raw_text": "Z = 3.2, p = 0.01 (one-tailed)", "textual_interpretation": "confirming a statistically significant reduction in systemic inflammation favoring the intervention group", "interpretation_dire