 commitment negatively correlated with stress (r=-0.313, p<0.001)."}, {"section": "discussion", "sentence": "Workplace commitment was also found to have a moderating and negative effect on both stress and burnout; that is, the more committed one is to their job, the less stress or burnout one experiences.", "keywords": ["moderating and negative effect", "less stress or burnout"], "direction": "unclear", "effect_strength": "unclear", "hedging": false, "claim": "Workplace commitment had a moderating and negative effect on stress and burnout, meaning higher commitment leads to less stress and burnout."}, {"section": "conclusion", "sentence": "Not only risk factors, but also protective factors, such as workplace commitment, merit further investigation.", "keywords": ["protective factors"], "direction": "unclear", "effect_strength": "unclear", "hedging": false, "claim": "Workplace commitment is a protective factor against stress and burnout."}], "primary_direction": "unclear", "has_cross_section_conflict": false, "any_hedging": false, "sections": ["results", "discussion", "conclusion"]}, {"test_type": "r", "statistic_value": 0.2, "df1": null, "df2": null, "reported_p": 0.001, "p_equality": null, "two_tailed": null, "raw_text": "Influenceatwork | -0.200** | 0.001 | -0.212** | <0.001", "textual_interpretation": "Influence at work exhibited a significant correlation with stress (r=-0.2, p=0.001) and burnout (r=-0.212, p<0.001), albeit a markedly weak negative correlation.", "interpretation_direction": "significant", "consistent": true, "notes": "None", "interpretations": [{"section": "results", "sentence": "Influence at work exhibited a significant correlation with stress (r=-0.2, p=0.001) and burnout (r=-0.212, p<0.001), albeit a markedly weak negative correlation.", "keywords": ["significant correlation", "markedly weak negative correlation"], "direction": "unclear", "effect_strength": "weak", "hedging": false, "claim": "Influence at work showed a weak negative correlatio